sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor A as 🛡️ Admin
    participant API as ⚙️ API
    participant DB as 🗄️ Database
    participant P as 🔁 Pipeline
    participant G as 🦊 Git forge
    participant S as 📦 Sandbox

    rect rgb(239, 246, 255)
        Note over A,DB: Storing a secret
        A->>API: POST /secrets { value }
        API->>API: AES-256-GCM(master key, random nonce,<br/>authenticated data = org:secret)
        API->>DB: nonce · tag · ciphertext + 4-character hint
        API-->>A: label and hint only — the value never comes back
    end
    rect rgb(236, 253, 245)
        Note over P,G: Using it, when a task runs
        P->>DB: read the ciphertext (by secret id AND organization)
        P->>P: decrypt in memory
        P->>G: clone / push (token passed through the environment, never on disk)
    end
    Note over S: The sandbox never receives the token
